# Doc invariants (anti-stale live docs)

Archived ledgers / PR evidence / task-log may narrate past Railway or Alpaca eras. **Live** docs must not.

## Live homes (update in the same commit as the posture change)

| Fact | Authoritative home |
|------|--------------------|
| Where the API runs / deploy | `AGENTS.md` §8 (+ `README.md` Deploy) |
| Public source home | `README.md` (+ `site/index.html` CTA) |
| Market-data / scanner SoT | `.cursor/rules/single-market-data-feed.mdc` |
| Roadmap NEXT / phase scope | `knowledge/obsidian/03-Nova-Decisions/Nova-Roadmap-Status.md` |
| Trading gates / `auto_live` | `AGENTS.md` Invariant #7 + ADR 007/009 |

When hosting, discovery provider, phase NEXT, or trading posture changes: update the matching live home(s) in the **same commit**. The PR body alone is not enough.

## Machine gate

```text
py -3 tools/doc_invariants.py
```

Wired in GitHub Actions (`agent-contract` job). Do not weaken patterns to silence a real drift -- fix the live doc or deliberately revise the invariant with evidence.

## Do not

- Restate deploy/hosting truth in many Obsidian notes (link the live home; banner archives).
- Treat `findings.md` or old decision bodies as current law when they conflict with the table above.
- Reintroduce Railway as the backend host, Alpaca as scanner SoT, or an absolute no-trading claim that ignores gated IBKR execution.
